E.2 Particle Filter for Intent Belief (Detailed)

```
Algorithm E.2: ParticleFilterUpdate
Input: Human h, observation sequence o_{1:t}, prior particles P_{t-1}
Output: Updated particles P_t

1: P_t = []
2: for each particle (g, u, a, w) in P_{t-1} do
3:   // Propagate latent state
4:   g' ~ P(g_t | g_{t-1}=g, a)     // goal transition
5:   u' ~ P(u_t | u_{t-1}=u)        // urgency evolution
6:   // Observation likelihood
7:   L = P(o_t | g', u', a)         // from Social Scene Graph
8:   w' = w * L
9:   P_t.append((g', u', a, w'))
10: end for
11: // Normalize weights
12: total_w = sum(w' for (_,_,_,w') in P_t)
13: for each particle in P_t do
14:   w' = w' / total_w
15: end for
16: // Resample if effective sample size low
17: N_eff = 1 / sum(w'^2 for (_,_,_,w') in P_t)
18: if N_eff < K/2 then
19:   P_t = SystematicResample(P_t)
20: end if
21: return P_t
```

E.3 Bi-Level Optimization (Detailed)

```
Algorithm E.3: BiLevelOptimization
Input: Coupling set K, beliefs {b_i}, horizon H, cost map C_social
Output: Trajectories {ξ_i} for i in K

1: // Build contention graph
2: G_c = (V=K, E=∅)
3: for i in K do
4:   for j in K, j != i do
5:     if ℓ_i > τ_ℓ and ℓ_j > τ_ℓ then
6:       E.add(i, j) with weight = mutual_liveness(i,j)
7:     end if
8:   end for
9: end for
10: // Priority assignment via minimum-cost maximum-flow
11: π = HungarianAssignment(G_c)  // π: K → {1,...,|K|}
12: // Sequential trajectory optimization
13: ξ = {}
14: for priority p = 1 to |K| do
15:   i = π^{-1}(p)
16:   // MPC with social cost from higher-priority agents
17:   ξ_i = solve_MPC(
18:     x_0 = current_pose(i),
19:     goal = expected_goal(i, b_i),
20:     cost = J_i + λ_social * C_social(·, {ξ_j}_{j: π(j)<p}),
21:     constraints = [dynamics, CBF_safety],
22:     horizon = H
23:   )
24:   ξ[i] = ξ_i
25: end for
26: return ξ
```

